 of piracy  under the name of buggy the genius  chester became the legal business of a  warlord yes there were hiccups like his  biggest breadwinners leaving at one  point but all in all it was a great  system unfortunately it didn't last long  since the world government  understandably decided to abolish the  warlord system buggy himself was  confronted by marines led by vice  admiral stainless he was planning to  motivate his men to fight and in the  chaos he was planning to slip away we  also saw the marines approaching other  warlords like mihawk those poor fools  that's where we left buggy and then  somehow just recently we received news  that he somehow managed to turn the  seemingly hopeless situation around and  not only that he became one of the yonko  as well so we still don't know exactly  how he got out of this exact situation  with stainless but we do know how he  became a yonko and wow it's brilliant  buggy's new organization we're told has  crocodile and mihawk as members yes it's  true just like so many people including  me were really hoping for like i said a  lot of us expected this to be the case  because of how awesome it would be and  it actually came to fruition and i'm so  hyped about it this is amazing and means  that buggy's crew now has the greatest  swordsman in the world outclassing  luffy's in at least that department for  now at least although i feel like soon  i'll have to do a poll on whether zorro  or mihawk would win in a fight now since  i love hearing your opinions and zorro  does keep getting stronger now in  reality mihawk probably joined because  it was a convenient partnership but it's  still awesome that now buggy at least  from the outside looking in looks like  he has mihawk and crocodile working  under him i can't wait to hear their  official reasons for joining leave your  thoughts in the comments below all i  know is that buggy is a genius and he  really made lemonade from lemons here he  turned a situation where the government  turned on him and used it as an  opportunity to make a kind of warlord  alliance absolutely brilliant and it  makes so much sense that the warlords  would do this since they were a great  force together government approval or  not the government really messed up when  they turned against buggy and i love to  see it also can't wait to see who else  buggy may have recruited in the meantime  another brilliant and unbelievably hyped  detail is that buggy put bounties on the  heads of the marines can you believe  that what a genius move that i didn't  expect to happen we always took it for  granted that having marine bounties  would be cool but it's not gonna happen  since they are issued by the marines but  now we have pirates unifying and  fighting back giving them bounties for a  change and i absolutely love it it's  brilliant i can't overemphasize how much  i love this idea you can see why this  counter system targeting marines alone  through their own bounties would make  buggy's organization so dangerous buggy  was already like my top 5 characters and  he really earned that position here we  are told though that no bounties are  revealed in this chapter although i  can't wait to compare pirate bounties to  marine bounties and see how they stack  up like what'll sakazuki's be compared  to shanks oda really is the hype  building master the chapter then goes on  we're told that neko and inu are staying  in wano probably to help momo guard it  and they have chosen carrot as their  successor to lead the mix so although  carrot will make a great ally it's clear  she is enjoying the straw hats as many  wish to see i know all of you guys care  a lot about this next one but shinobu is  beautiful again thanks to aramaki's  attack we're told and by the way i was  kidding i know this is not the most  interesting news to anybody but hey i am  never one to complain about more  attractive women in one piece and i know  this middle stuff wasn't the most  interesting per se but trust me the  chapter finishes strong with relevancy  so just be patient we're told luffy kid  and law set off on different routes not  something i'm surprised by or  disappointed about although i definitely  think we haven't seen the last of a law  and luffy alliance kid is looking for  someone but it's not shanks we're told  and that makes sense we all know he'd be  able to accomplish nothing against the  shanks from last chapter wow i still  can't get over how epic shanks was then  we're told we see yamato standing on the  castle roof why is this significant  because i just told you the straw hats  left and although many thought yamato  would join including yamato and even i  thought it would be great i also kept  saying it's hard to believe since yamato  has the guardian deity of wano fruit  that belongs in wano of course plus they  kept not showing luffy officially  letting her join and there was that  moment with momo i pointed out in the  last chapter which hinted yamato would  stay we're told to be careful and the  yamato situation is unclear at the  moment and that no reliable spoiler  providers explain what exactly happened  so we'll have to wait and see before  coming to a definitive conclusion i mean  it's possible that yamato could join  them later but as i've been pointing out  there has been so much foreshadowing  that yamato would stay that i can't say  i'd be surprised if yamato didn't join  the crew at this point like for example  imagine if chaka the jackal whose fruit  is considered to be the guardian deity  of alabasta joined the crew and left to  do his own thing it would never happen  and now that we know that zone fruits  have wills of their own and they must  have some sway on their users after all  chopper's personality is probably more  human zone fruit than reindeer at this  point then it's likely that yamato will  be influenced to stay or that the fruit  picked yamato because it knew yamato  would stay when the time came don't get 